# PSR-0a — Change-train map and exit gate

This snapshot assigns every dirty path to exactly one change train so PSR-0b can
split commits without a bulk cleanup. Machine-readable rows live in
[`psr-0a-worktree-inventory.yaml`](./psr-0a-worktree-inventory.yaml). Regenerate
with:

```bash
node scripts/ops/psr-0a-inventory.mjs
```

## Exit gate (PSR-0a)

| Criterion | Result |
| --- | --- |
| Every entry has `owner` and `class` | Pass (`missing_owner=0`, `missing_class=0`) |
| `change_train: unclassified` count | Pass (`0`) |
| Accidental staged files | Pass (`staged_count=0`) |
| Generated dirty paths listed with `regenerate-then-commit` | Pass (28 paths) |
| Recovery baseline documented | Pass — [`psr-0a-recovery-baseline.mdoc`](./psr-0a-recovery-baseline.mdoc) |

**PSR-0a gate: GREEN.** No product cleanup, regenerate, or train commit was
performed in this wave.

## Change trains (final counts)

Expanded `-uall` inventory after all PSR-0a artifacts (`porcelain_records: 256`):

| change_train | Count | Typical `psr0b_action` |
| --- | ---: | --- |
| `denali-gravity-harbor` | 114 | `commit-with-train` |
| `sdk-generated-registry` | 59 | `commit-with-train` / `regenerate-then-commit` (28 generated) |
| `api-platform-behavior` | 31 | `commit-with-train` |
| `root-command-analysis` | 26 | `commit-with-train` |
| `documentation-cleanup` | 16 | `commit-with-train` / `defer` for roadmap drift |
| `local-scratch-artifact` | 10 | `keep-untracked-until-psr1` |
| `unclassified` | 0 | — |

| Role summary | |
| --- | --- |
| `denali-gravity-harbor` | Harbor package, Denali/Urban gravity adapters, guest/marketing/portal Harbor smoke, gravity guards |
| `sdk-generated-registry` | `workspace-sdk` (incl. new `src/http`), plugin-host, root/API package membership, lockfile, **all `*.generated.*`** |
| `api-platform-behavior` | Non-generated `apps/api` behavior, finance nav/access, portal session cookie |
| `root-command-analysis` | `docs/platform/ROOT_COMMAND_*`, DX scripts (`pre-commit-fast`, `test-changed`), inventory ops script |
| `documentation-cleanup` | Architecture remediation SoTs, Harbor certification doc, audit snapshots |
| `local-scratch-artifact` | Root ad-hoc helpers (deleted tracked + untracked `tmp-*`), pycache, ignore-policy deferrals |

Re-run `node scripts/ops/psr-0a-inventory.mjs` after any porcelain drift before
starting PSR-0b.

## Generated regenerate list (28)

All `class: generated` rows use `psr0b_action: regenerate-then-commit` and
`owner: codegen`. Do **not** hand-edit them in PSR-0b; refresh via
`pnpm run generate:workspace-registry` (or the owning generator) and diff
against manifest before commit.

Exact paths are enumerated under `generated_paths` in the YAML inventory.

## Border-path overrides (manual)

These paths can span trains; overrides are encoded in
`scripts/ops/psr-0a-inventory.mjs` (`OVERRIDES`):

| Path | Assigned train | Rationale |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `package.json` / `pnpm-lock.yaml` | `sdk-generated-registry` | Membership/lockfile follow generate |
| `apps/api/package.json` | `sdk-generated-registry` | Workspace membership ↔ manifest |
| `dependency-cruiser.config.js` | `sdk-generated-registry` | Boundary allowlists track workspace add |
| Portal login / providers / catalog flow | `denali-gravity-harbor` | Guest product surface |
| `apps/portal/src/auth/build-session-cookie.ts` | `api-platform-behavior` | Auth platform, not branding |
| Finance web pages / nav access | `api-platform-behavior` | Finance host UX |
| `.github/workflows/phase-0-gate.yml` | `root-command-analysis` | `defer` into PSR-3 unless blocking |
| Root delete candidates (`bootstrap-server.sh`, …) | `local-scratch-artifact` | PSR-1b after consumer proof |

## Ignored scratch (not porcelain)

On-disk counts at inventory time (excluding `node_modules` / `dist`):

| Tree | Present | File count |
| --- | --- | ---: |
| `TEMP/` | yes | 334 |
| `temp/` | yes | 28 |
| `docs/temp/` | yes | 1 |
| `tmp/` | yes | 1 |

These remain **out of scope** for deletion until PSR-2 promotion / PSR-1
allowlist cleanup. Tracked docs that reference them are a later wave.

## PSR-0b handoff (do not execute in PSR-0a)

Suggested commit order (one train per commit/PR; no cleanup mix):

1. `documentation-cleanup` — remediation + snapshot docs (this folder)
2. `sdk-generated-registry` — SDK/http + **regenerate** generated sources + lockfile/membership
3. `denali-gravity-harbor` — Harbor + gravity product surfaces
4. `api-platform-behavior` — API/finance/session behavior
5. `root-command-analysis` — ROOT_COMMAND evidence + DX scripts (or defer pack to PSR-2/3)
6. Leave `local-scratch-artifact` dirty until PSR-1

Rollback for any train commit: revert that commit; recovery of pre-split dirty
state uses [`psr-0a-recovery-baseline.mdoc`](./psr-0a-recovery-baseline.mdoc)
plus untracked content hashes in the YAML.
